COMMENT     REVIEWED REFSEQ: This record has been curated by NCBI staff. The
            reference sequence was derived from AL034405.16, Z82208.1,
            KF459400.1 and AL136450.8.
            
            On Apr 2, 2020 this sequence version replaced NM_021946.4.
            
            Summary: The protein encoded by this gene is a transcriptional
            corepressor that is found tethered to promoter regions by
            DNA-binding proteins. The encoded protein can interact with several
            different class II histone deacetylases to repress transcription.
            Two transcript variants encoding different isoforms have been found
            for this gene. [provided by RefSeq, May 2010].
            
            Sequence Note:.
            
            Publication Note:  This RefSeq record includes a subset of the
            publications that are available for this gene. Please see the Gene
            record to access additional publications.
            
