REFERENCE   7  (bases 1 to 3482)
  AUTHORS   Del Arco,A.
  TITLE     Novel variants of human SCaMC-3, an isoform of the ATP-Mg/P(i)
            mitochondrial carrier, generated by alternative splicing from
