REFERENCE   3  (bases 1 to 4571)
  AUTHORS   Hong,M., Srivastava,K., Kim,S., Allen,B.L., Leahy,D.J., Hu,P.,
            Roessler,E., Krauss,R.S. and Muenke,M.
  TITLE     BOC is a modifier gene in holoprosencephaly
  JOURNAL   Hum Mutat 38 (11), 1464-1470 (2017)
   PUBMED   28677295
  REMARK    GeneRIF: we report the identification of missense BOC variants in
            HPE patients. Consistent with these alleles functioning as HPE
            modifiers, individual variant BOC proteins had either loss- or
            gain-of-function properties in cell-based SHH signaling assays.
